{"id":"clairvoyant","name":"Clairvoyant","tagline":"Ask questions, get psychic answers","blurb":"Does he love you? Should you have pizza for dinner?","description":"Does he love you? Should you have pizza for dinner? Is there such thing as a stupid question? Discover the answers to these questions and more with Clairvoyant, the magic 8-ball inspired fortune teller.\n\n• Ask a question, then open Clairvoyant for an answer.\n\n• Not satisfied? Ask again, then hit \"Ask Again\" to try again.\n\n• Do what you'd like with the answers—just don't shoot the messenger!\n\nWarning: it has been noted that “such a program can lead people away from God, as they are making an idol of an application and putting their faith into a virtual 8 ball.” Proceed at your own risk!","developer":"Cassidy James Blaede","icon":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/cassidyjames/clairvoyant/db3c82b1374fef6966c5beb348be0759/icons/128x128/com.cassidyjames.clairvoyant.png","screenshots":[{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/cassidyjames/clairvoyant/db3c82b1374fef6966c5beb348be0759/screenshots/image-1_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/cassidyjames/clairvoyant/db3c82b1374fef6966c5beb348be0759/screenshots/image-1_752x437@1.png","w":1172,"h":682},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/cassidyjames/clairvoyant/db3c82b1374fef6966c5beb348be0759/screenshots/image-2_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/cassidyjames/clairvoyant/db3c82b1374fef6966c5beb348be0759/screenshots/image-2_752x437@1.png","w":1172,"h":682},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/cassidyjames/clairvoyant/db3c82b1374fef6966c5beb348be0759/screenshots/image-3_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/cassidyjames/clairvoyant/db3c82b1374fef6966c5beb348be0759/screenshots/image-3_752x437@1.png","w":1172,"h":682},{"full":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/cassidyjames/clairvoyant/db3c82b1374fef6966c5beb348be0759/screenshots/image-4_orig.png","thumb":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/com/cassidyjames/